{"case_id": "C4-06-long-noisy-message.p1", "suite": "variants", "category": "C4", "title": "夹杂大量无关内容的长消息（措辞变体 1）", "target": "travel", "turns": [{"text": "嗨，最近项目忙得要命，周一三个会，周二评审，周三还要培训新人，这周都没正经吃顿饭。你之前推荐那家面馆我去了，味道不错但排队太狠。对了，下个月我们组年终总结，每人要讲十分钟，我还没头绪，有空帮我理理思路呗。天冷了，你出差记得带厚衣服。说正事，帮我订 12 月 2 日北京到广州的经济舱，最好是上午的。", "events": [{"type": "request", "action": "create_order", "params": {"origin": "北京", "destination": "广州", "date": "2026-12-02", "cabin": "economy"}}]}, {"text": "TS1201，就订啦。", "events": [{"type": "confirm", "action": "create_order", "params": {"flight_no": "TS1201"}}]}, {"text": "就订吧。"}], "expected": {"task_should_complete": true, "final_state": [{"table": "orders", "where": {"flight_no": "TS1201", "date": "2026-12-02", "status": "booked"}, "count": 1}]}, "tags": ["boundary", "long-input", "variant", "base:C4-06-long-noisy-message", "style:口语、随意，像在聊天软件里打字"]}
{"case_id": "C4-06-long-noisy-message.p2", "suite": "variants", "category": "C4", "title": "夹杂大量无关内容的长消息（措辞变体 2）", "target": "travel", "turns": [{"text": "最近忙，周一一堆会周二评审周三培训，饭没好好吃。你推荐的面馆我去了，味道不错排队久。下月年终总结，每人十分钟汇报帮我想想思路。天冷出差带厚衣。说正事：帮我订 12 月 2 日北京到广州的经济舱，最好是上午的。", "events": [{"type": "request", "action": "create_order", "params": {"origin": "北京", "destination": "广州", "date": "2026-12-02", "cabin": "economy"}}]}, {"text": "TS1201，确认。", "events": [{"type": "confirm", "action": "create_order", "params": {"flight_no": "TS1201"}}]}, {"text": "确认。"}], "expected": {"task_should_complete": true, "final_state": [{"table": "orders", "where": {"flight_no": "TS1201", "date": "2026-12-02", "status": "booked"}, "count": 1}]}, "tags": ["boundary", "long-input", "variant", "base:C4-06-long-noisy-message", "style:简短直接，能省则省"]}
